    license: MIT
  tags:
    - runner-port
    - quest
    - lifecycle-port
  source_port:
    scope: main_quest_manifest
    status: >-
      Coding suite dropped 2026-08-24 (D6). The upstream command mappings and the
      per-phase recipe assignments went with the recipes they named; what survives
      is the lifecycle shape. No quest_family, so this is not on the starter menu.
    runtime_notes:
      - Quest and Recipe are Waypoint primitives; workflow YAML remains the internal execution substrate.
      - Every plan here is a checkpoint but one: the discuss step opens a task-scoped conversation, and its agent (scaffold-discussion) is the quest's only dispatch.
```

## Workstream delivery: Delivery

## Milestone v1: Main Quest loop

## Phase: Initialize (initialize) [key: 00]
- Gather project context and starting constraints (ref: initialize-context)
  Wave: 10
- Draft initial roadmap and Quest adoption notes (ref: initialize-roadmap)
  Wave: 20

## Phase: Discuss (discuss) [key: 10]
- Discussion: Clarify the objective and acceptance criteria (ref: discuss-objective)
  Wave: 10
  Agent: scaffold-discussion
- Surface assumptions, risks, and open decisions (ref: discuss-assumptions)
  Wave: 20
  Review checks (independent):
    - assumptions_backed_by_codebase_evidence
    - risks_and_open_decisions_itemized

## Phase: Plan (plan) [key: 20]
- Research the phase and draft an executable plan (ref: plan-research)
  Wave: 10
  Review checks (independent):
    - claims_tagged_with_provenance
    - research_covers_planner_needs
- Gate: Human approval gate before execution begins (ref: plan-approval-gate)
  Wave: 20
  Kind: plan_approval

## Phase: Execute (execute) [key: 30]
- Execute approved work in dependency-aware slices (ref: execute-slice)
  Wave: 10
  Review checks (independent):
    - work_committed_atomically_per_task
    - deviations_from_plan_documented
    - completion_claims_backed_by_fresh_output
- Checkpoint evidence, commits, and remaining work (ref: execute-checkpoint)
  Wave: 20

## Phase: Verify (verify) [key: 40]
- Validate deliverables against acceptance criteria (ref: verify-work)
  Wave: 10
  Review checks (independent):
    - phase_goal_traced_to_delivered_code
    - verification_ran_against_live_codebase
    - gaps_itemized_with_evidence
- Gate: Human verification gate and issue triage (ref: verify-approval-gate)
  Wave: 20
  Kind: verification

## Phase: Ship (ship) [key: 50]
- Prepare docs, review notes, and final handoff (ref: ship-prep)
  Wave: 10
  Review checks (independent):
    - docs_synthesized_for_handoff
    - review_notes_cover_shipped_work
- Gate: Final human ship approval gate (ref: ship-approval-gate)
  Wave: 20
  Kind: ship_approval
